     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif\">The session is usually takes up at most the first hour, and then the second hour is working on your own projects. </div><div class=\"gmail_default\" style=\"font-family:times new roman,serif\">I am excited to hear today&#39;s talk!! </div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br clear=\"all\"><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b>~ Kristina</b></i></font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><br></b></i></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;times new roman&quot;,serif\">Kristina Wolf</span><br><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">Restoration Ecology Lab</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">Ph.D. Candidate, Graduate Group in Ecology</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">Department of Plant Sciences</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">B.S. Animal Science, M.S. Soil Science</font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><a href=\"tel:(530)%20750-9771\" value=\"+15307509771\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">(530) 750-9771</a></font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\">&quot;We have to remember that what we observe is not nature herself, but nature exposed to our method of questioning.&quot; ~ Werner Heisenberg</font></div>\r\n<div><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"> </font></div></div></div></div>\r\n<br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
